{"1498550":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Infinity: HexaDome Tactics","steam_appid":1498550,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4328870,4962680,4972800,5241500],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD COMMUNITY<\/h1><p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-Based Tactical Battles<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinity: HexaDome Tactics<\/strong> is a turn-based tactics game set in the Infinity universe. Lead your team through a campaign where each match reveals more of the world while unlocking new champions and cosmetics.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/230087bb3ba30b2a7f25ef8b3cd1a5ff.poster.avif?t=1793893733\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/230087bb3ba30b2a7f25ef8b3cd1a5ff.webm?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/230087bb3ba30b2a7f25ef8b3cd1a5ff.mp4?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenges &amp; Duels<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the campaign, test your skills in tactical challenges with unique conditions.<br>Face AI, friends, or other players in duels, either in friendly matches or competitive games.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/1d9597f5ef2de227749d96c8894c4899.poster.avif?t=1793893733\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/1d9597f5ef2de227749d96c8894c4899.webm?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/1d9597f5ef2de227749d96c8894c4899.mp4?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Team<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your squad of champions. Each fighter has unique strengths: ranged combat, melee attacks, control, or support.<br>Make the right plays, impress the crowd, and unleash powerful ultimate abilities.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/67e360cb665a9375298561562f91bd7d.poster.avif?t=1793893733\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/67e360cb665a9375298561562f91bd7d.webm?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/67e360cb665a9375298561562f91bd7d.mp4?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Management<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action point matters. Should you attack now, capture the objective, or prepare your next move?<br>Use tactical cards, manage your resources, and outsmart your opponents to claim victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/48d2d2843a62a26429cba5eef0922d9c.poster.avif?t=1793893733\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/48d2d2843a62a26429cba5eef0922d9c.webm?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/48d2d2843a62a26429cba5eef0922d9c.mp4?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-Based Tactical Battles<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinity: HexaDome Tactics<\/strong> is a turn-based tactics game set in the Infinity universe. Lead your team through a campaign where each match reveals more of the world while unlocking new champions and cosmetics.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/230087bb3ba30b2a7f25ef8b3cd1a5ff.poster.avif?t=1793893733\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/230087bb3ba30b2a7f25ef8b3cd1a5ff.webm?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/230087bb3ba30b2a7f25ef8b3cd1a5ff.mp4?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenges &amp; Duels<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the campaign, test your skills in tactical challenges with unique conditions.<br>Face AI, friends, or other players in duels, either in friendly matches or competitive games.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/1d9597f5ef2de227749d96c8894c4899.poster.avif?t=1793893733\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/1d9597f5ef2de227749d96c8894c4899.webm?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/1d9597f5ef2de227749d96c8894c4899.mp4?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Team<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your squad of champions. Each fighter has unique strengths: ranged combat, melee attacks, control, or support.<br>Make the right plays, impress the crowd, and unleash powerful ultimate abilities.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/67e360cb665a9375298561562f91bd7d.poster.avif?t=1793893733\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/67e360cb665a9375298561562f91bd7d.webm?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/67e360cb665a9375298561562f91bd7d.mp4?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Management<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action point matters. Should you attack now, capture the objective, or prepare your next move?<br>Use tactical cards, manage your resources, and outsmart your opponents to claim victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/48d2d2843a62a26429cba5eef0922d9c.poster.avif?t=1793893733\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/48d2d2843a62a26429cba5eef0922d9c.webm?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/extras\/48d2d2843a62a26429cba5eef0922d9c.mp4?t=1793893733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Discover the story of the Aristeia world in single-player or storm into PvP battles! Turn-based battles, 12 heroes, varied arenas, deckbuilding with dozens of tactical cards. Assemble the perfect team, use hundreds of insane combos, and become HexaDome champion. And bring a friend!","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French<strong>*<\/strong>, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","reviews":"“Infinity: HexaDome Tactics is a stylish and very fun tactical battle game, plus it’s got some original ideas and it’s the first video game adaptation of a Corvus Belli franchise. So definitely check it out! There’s more to this game than what appears on the surface!”<br>Preview – Niche Gamer<br><br>“There aren’t too many games out there that can mix a handful of genres and come out the other end with something entertaining. Thankfully, Infinity: HexaDome Tactics is one of those games.”<br>Preview – Digital Chumps<br><br>“This game is a fantastic surprise for all tactical game enthusiasts. Between the challenge of the campaign and the intensity of the online duels, you won't get bored. It's an addictive title that I highly recommend if you enjoy managing your resources and outsmarting your opponents.”<br>Preview – Geek-o-Polis<br>","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/567acf57b4c789840f4f3a68eecd0ee6155dc9a3\/header.jpg?t=1793893733","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/6feda8350f288948074316a7526b5ce91c77e4d5\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793893733","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/6feda8350f288948074316a7526b5ce91c77e4d5\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793893733","website":"https:\/\/www.thehexadome.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10, 64-Bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 2.5 GHz \/ AMD Ryzen 5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GTX 1050 \/ AMD RX550<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"© 2024. All rights reserved. Developed by Blindspot Games.<br \/>\r\nBased on Corvus Belli's Aristeia.","developers":["Blindspot Games"],"publishers":["Blindspot Games"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":1999,"final":1799,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"$19.99","final_formatted":"$17.99"},"packages":[528266],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Infinity: HexaDome Tactics","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":528266,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Infinity: HexaDome Tactics - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$19.99<\/span> $17.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":1799}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":36,"description":"Online PvP"},{"id":55,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":58,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":18,"description":"Partial Controller Support"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/505d0b61aafccb71e6f8c32f4bff20cd4e953bfc\/ss_505d0b61aafccb71e6f8c32f4bff20cd4e953bfc.600x338.jpg?t=1793893733","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/505d0b61aafccb71e6f8c32f4bff20cd4e953bfc\/ss_505d0b61aafccb71e6f8c32f4bff20cd4e953bfc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793893733"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/e2b5546f0c2737070bd120ccf015140ea714a4d0\/ss_e2b5546f0c2737070bd120ccf015140ea714a4d0.600x338.jpg?t=1793893733","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/e2b5546f0c2737070bd120ccf015140ea714a4d0\/ss_e2b5546f0c2737070bd120ccf015140ea714a4d0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793893733"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/a9b9cc18b4a75b2cf1443d6d0057bcf6ebc6a15f\/ss_a9b9cc18b4a75b2cf1443d6d0057bcf6ebc6a15f.600x338.jpg?t=1793893733","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1498550\/a9b9cc18b4a75b2cf1443d6d0057bcf6ebc6a15f\/ss_a9b9cc18b4a75b2cf1443d6d0057bcf6ebc6a15f.1920x1080.jpg?t